# Rayt Me

Portable verified professional reputation. Company **RAYTME LLC**. Live site **raytme.me**, API **api.raytme.me**. App ids `me.rate.rayt`. English controls legal text.

The website sells, hosts accounts, and shows a public card. Web visitors can rate via `/p/:id/rate` after email verification (lightweight web-guest account). Professional snapshot and My List remain app-only.

